The function is reasonably robust: it detects whether CSVs have headers, attempts to auto-detect the month and sales columns if you don't provide them, parses various month formats (month names, numeric month, YYYY-MM, YYYY-MM-DD, common date formats), and treats each matching file as one series on the plot (labeled by filename).

